.SH "NAME"
mash\-bounds \- print a table of Mash error bounds
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
\fBmash bounds\fP [options]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
Print a table of Mash error bounds for various sketch sizes and Mash
distances based on a given k\-mer size and desired confidence. Note that
these calculations assume sequences are much larger than the sketch
size, and will overestimate error bounds if this is not the case.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.sp
\fB\-h\fP
.RS 4
Help
.RE
.sp
\fB\-k\fP <int>
.RS 4
k\-mer size. (1\-32) [21]
.RE
.sp
\fB\-p\fP <num>
.RS 4
Mash distance estimates will be within the given error bounds with this
probability. (0\-1) [0.99]
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.sp
mash(1)
